; Stage 14 AVR-6 (design/stage14/avr-targets.md §5) — the `:const` declaration
; attribute on a defvar global. `(defvar :const name:type init)` emits an LLVM
; `constant` (read-only linkage) instead of a mutable `global`; on mapped-flash
; AVR parts a constant table stays in flash (zero RAM). A plain defvar is
; unchanged, so existing programs are byte-identical. Host-only emission gate.
(defvar :const answer:i32 42)
(defvar mutable-count:i32 0)

(defn main ():i32
  (set! mutable-count answer)
  (return mutable-count))
